  "description": "Brass Monkey is now open and ready for all kinds of monkey business. Whether you want to play, party or dine, swing down with your gang for some seriously good times. From 12 bowling lanes, and the best retro arcade games in Dubai, Brass Monkey is the ultimate hangout.Get your munch on with tacos, sliders, pizzas, quesadillas and old school desserts , all washed down with a variety of beverages. Grab a bite or enjoy a full blown feast of delicious dishes which will leave you craving more! Whatever you do – leave space for dessert and a cocktail or three!",
